{"_path":"/ja/correct-beach","_dir":"ja","_draft":false,"_partial":false,"_locale":"","title":"Correct Beach","description":"バルト海の浜辺では、太陽の光を受けてきらめく琥珀のかけらや、砂の中にひっそりと隠れている琥珀を見つけることがよくあります。","body":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"バルト海の浜辺では、太陽の光を受けてきらめく琥珀のかけらや、砂の中にひっそりと隠れている琥珀を見つけることがよくあります。"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"img","props":{"alt":"image alt text","src":"/img/baltic/polawianie.jpg"},"children":[]},{"type":"element","tag":"span","props":{"className":["text-subtitle2","text-caption","self-center"]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Photo: Michal Kosior"}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"バルト海の浜辺では、毎日のように琥珀を見つけることができますが、特に秋や冬の嵐の後には、海底から琥珀が波に運ばれ、砂浜に打ち上げられることが多くなります。"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"img","props":{"alt":"image alt text","src":"/img/baltic/IMG_20201226_111646216_small.jpg"},"children":[]},{"type":"element","tag":"span","props":{"className":["text-subtitle2","text-caption","self-center"]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Photo: Michal Kosior"}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"琥珀採集者たちはよく言います。『私たちが琥珀を見つけるのではなく、琥珀が私たちを見つけるのだ』と。"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"琥珀を海から引き揚げるため、琥珀採集者たちは長い棒に取り付けた特殊なネットを使用しています。"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"img","props":{"alt":"image alt text","src":"/img/baltic/DSC_0062.jpg"},"children":[]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"琥珀を探す作業は通常長時間にわたることが多く、夜間にも行われます。水や寒さから身を守るため、採集者たちは暖かく、防水性のある服を着用します。かつてはアザラシの皮で作られていましたが、現在では、これらの衣服は最新の技術を駆使した素材で作られています。"}]}],"toc":{"title":"","searchDepth":2,"depth":2,"links":[]}},"_type":"markdown","_id":"content:ja:correct-beach.md","_source":"content","_file":"ja/correct-beach.md","_stem":"ja/correct-beach","_extension":"md"}